        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Escamoso. Hakamo-o entra em lutas tão intensas que as escamas dos braços caem, e braços expostos são vistos como prova de bravura. Ele bate as escamas enquanto dança para se animar, soltando um rugido de guerra.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Hakamo-o pode evoluir para Kommo-o no nível 15 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Autotomize, Bide, Leer, Protect, Sky Uppercut, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Dragon Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Work Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Dragon Claw, Noble Roar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Dragon Dance, Outrage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Close Combat</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Aqua Tail, Attract, Body Slam, Breaking Swipe, Brick Break, Brutal Swing, Bulk Up, Bulldoze, Close Combat, Coaching, Confide, Double Team, Double-Edge, Draco Meteor, Dragon Cheer, Dragon Claw, Dragon Dance, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Drain Punch, Dual Chop, Earthquake, Echoed Voice, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Hidden Power, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Low Kick, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Metal Claw, Outrage, Payback, Protect, Rest, Return, Reversal, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Sandstorm, Scale Shot, Scary Face, Screech, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Throat Chop, Toxic, Upper Hand, Uproar, Vacuum Wave, Work Up, X-Scissor</p>",
